== Overview ==
The '''Claw Toilet''' is an extremely strong [[Toilets|enemy]] which appears in [[Nightmare Mode]] and [[Endless Mode]]. The Claw Toilet's special ability is that it is able to grab onto units and stun them. 
== Appearance==
The Claw Toilet is a flying toilet with three claws and a black toilet.

== Waves==
== [[Nightmare Mode]]==
*Wave 37: x1
*Wave 41: x1
*Wave 43: x1
*Wave 48: x1
==Health==
===[[Nightmare Mode]]===
* Wave 37: 512,000 HP
* Wave 41: 560,000 HP
* Wave 43: 584,000 HP
* Wave 48: 644,000 HP

==Strategy==
*High DPS units are recommended as it has more HP.
*[[Medic Cameraman]] and [[Camera Repair Drone]] can unstun units stunned by this enemy.
*If it gets too far, [[Secret Agent]] can be used to quickly do damage to this enemy.
*Level 5/6 [[Upgraded Titan Cameraman]], [[TV Woman]], and [[Mech Cameraman]] can slow this enemy down, making it easier to defeat.
*[[Upgraded Titan Speakerman]], [[Shield Cameraman]] can absorb stuns from the Claw Toilet, making it stuck on its spot and not do any stunning also not being able to reach your base and do damage

== Trivia==
* This is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Detainer_Astro_Toilet Detainer Astro Toilet] 1.0 from the series.
